      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "welcome",
        "text": "先自我介绍一下喵，你可以叫我，豌豆酱",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "这里是你的院子里喵，等下会有僵尸想要吃掉你的脑子哦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "zako",
        "text": "但是你笨笨的肯定不会打僵尸啦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "smile",
        "text": "所以咱就给了你豌豆射手喵，打僵尸很厉害哦",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "tsundere",
        "text": "才...才不是要帮你呢！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "tsundere",
        "text": "只是想让你知道咱很厉害喵",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      },
      {
        "character": "pvzce:pea_chan",
        "portrait": "scared",
        "text": "不好！僵尸要来了喵！快上！",
        "voice": "",
        "side": "left"
      }
    ]
  }
